Task make_5_lvl3:
Propose a retrosynthesis route to synthesize the molecule with SMILES O[C@H]1C[C@@H](O[C@@H]([C@@H]1C)/C=C(CO)/C)C/C=C/C=C/C(O)=O. The leaves on the retrosynthesis tree should be commercially available chemicals. The price of all the chemicals cannot exceed $9999.0. The final route should not surpass 5 steps.

Required submission format:
Submit a JSON object representing the retrosynthesis route. It must follow the same JSON format as the next example: `{
  "type": "mol",
  "smiles": "CO",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "reaction",
      "template_id": 1234,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "BrC"
        },
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "[OH-]"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}`.



You must think what to do next. You can use some of the tools available in the system.

When you think that the task is completed, you can submit the answer.
For that, answer with: "Final Answer: <your answer>". It is very important to follow this format.

